WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:02.220
Sorry, Jun.

00:02.220 --> 00:04.930
I promised Misuzu and Carol 
I'd walk home with them today.

00:04.930 --> 00:07.140
It's cool. Don't worry about it.

00:07.140 --> 00:09.060
You're taking this awfully well, Jun-kun.

00:09.060 --> 00:10.780
Not going to get all dejected this time?

00:10.780 --> 00:14.410
I'll never get dejected over not 
going home together anymore.

00:14.410 --> 00:17.820
I don't want to be the kind 
of guy who ties Tomo down.

00:17.820 --> 00:18.810
Jun...

00:21.110 --> 00:24.100
What the... S-Stop!

00:25.710 --> 00:28.880
Lately... Actually, for a while now...

00:28.880 --> 00:32.630
I think it started when he started 
to see me as a girl, to be honest...

00:33.090 --> 00:36.890
But Jun's been so relaxed, 
it's actually kinda pissing me off.

00:36.890 --> 00:37.680
I get it.

00:37.680 --> 00:38.640
I get it, too.

00:38.640 --> 00:40.600
It's like I'm the only one freaking out,

00:40.600 --> 00:43.560
and it makes me feel like I've lost.

00:43.560 --> 00:46.440
I don't think it's an issue 
of winning or losing,

00:46.440 --> 00:49.650
but I get that you want to 
see him acting flustered.

00:49.650 --> 00:52.440
Then... why not kiss him?

00:52.440 --> 00:55.110
Huh?! K-Kiss him?! Are you...

00:55.110 --> 00:57.890
If it was that easy, I wouldn't 
be suffering like this!

00:57.890 --> 01:00.280
You could try watching 
a kissing scene together.

01:00.280 --> 01:02.750
I bet that would make him think about it.

01:02.750 --> 01:05.330
D-Does it really work like that?

01:05.780 --> 01:07.920
It'll be Christmas soon.

01:07.920 --> 01:09.960
Why don't you go see this together?

01:23.680 --> 01:28.980
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight,
 it always lands</i>

01:28.980 --> 01:34.110
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart,
 I miss every time</i>

01:34.110 --> 01:39.450
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

01:39.450 --> 01:43.950
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

01:43.950 --> 01:49.710
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

01:49.710 --> 01:54.760
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

01:54.760 --> 02:00.890
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

02:00.890 --> 02:06.180
<i>The moment you turn to face me,
 take that! Telepathy</i>

02:06.180 --> 02:11.650
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

02:11.650 --> 02:16.530
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

02:16.530 --> 02:22.530
<i>I want to know everything, 
I want to know everything</i>

02:22.530 --> 02:25.080
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

02:25.080 --> 02:27.710
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

02:27.710 --> 02:32.460
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

02:34.380 --> 02:36.920
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

02:36.920 --> 02:39.380
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

02:40.090 --> 02:42.470
<i>Telepathy</i>

02:44.220 --> 02:48.020
<b>To Stay by Your Side...</b>

02:44.930 --> 02:46.640
"To Stay by Your Side..."

02:53.520 --> 02:54.360
Jun!

03:00.070 --> 03:01.320
Did you wait long?

03:04.030 --> 03:07.040
You look kinda grown-up today.

03:07.040 --> 03:08.500
You think so?

03:08.500 --> 03:10.830
What about me? Well? Well?

03:11.210 --> 03:14.130
Hey, c'mon! Look at me!

03:14.420 --> 03:15.380
Tomo...

03:15.880 --> 03:19.670
You look... cute today. Pretty, in fact.

03:20.340 --> 03:23.760
There's just something special 
about this look. I really like it.

03:25.970 --> 03:31.020
Sorry... I'm not used to this kind 
of thing, so I can't say it well...

03:31.020 --> 03:33.190
Y-Yeah...

03:33.190 --> 03:35.520
<i>Damn him!</i>

03:39.400 --> 03:41.610
We're gonna see this today!

03:41.610 --> 03:42.530
What?!

03:41.990 --> 03:42.780
<b>This Love Is the Real Deal!! A Story of Pure Love</b>

03:42.530 --> 03:44.660
Are you actually serious?

03:42.780 --> 03:48.410
<b>This Love Is the Real Deal!! A Story of Pure Love</b>

03:44.660 --> 03:48.410
C'mon, Jun. We're not little kids anymore.

03:49.080 --> 03:51.870
You can't panic over a little kiss.

03:51.870 --> 03:55.000
Wh-When did you turn into 
that kind of adult?!

03:55.000 --> 03:55.710
Heh!

03:56.340 --> 03:59.550
<b>This Love Is the Real Deal!! A Story of Pure Love</b>

03:56.340 --> 03:59.550
<i>Staring at this thing for 
a whole week paid off!</i>

04:00.420 --> 04:02.010
<i>Wait, Haruko!</i>

04:03.180 --> 04:06.600
<i>We should stop seeing each other.</i>

04:06.600 --> 04:07.720
<i>But why?!</i>

04:08.470 --> 04:11.980
<i>You're someone I must never love!</i>

04:12.310 --> 04:14.310
<i>Forgive me, Keita-kun.</i>

04:14.900 --> 04:19.610
When it gets to the kissing scene, 
put your hand on top of his.

04:19.860 --> 04:22.280
<i>The effect will be immediate.</i>

04:22.700 --> 04:26.160
<i>All right! Bring it on, kissing scene!</i>

04:26.620 --> 04:28.620
<i>Wait, what?!</i>

04:28.620 --> 04:31.200
<i>We can't! Not here!</i>

04:31.620 --> 04:33.460
<i>I can't hold back anymore!</i>

04:34.870 --> 04:36.330
<i>I love you, Haruko.</i>

04:36.790 --> 04:39.800
<i>Okay. Come to me, Keita-kun.</i>

04:39.800 --> 04:41.420
<i>Haruko... Haruko!</i>

04:41.630 --> 04:45.380
<i>Did Misuzu go see this movie by herself?!</i>

04:45.380 --> 04:47.590
<i>This is way beyond just a kiss!</i>

04:47.590 --> 04:51.600
<i>If I put my hand on his now, 
it'll look like I'm asking for this!</i>

04:51.850 --> 04:54.600
<i>Damn! He's really taking this in!</i>

04:54.850 --> 04:56.350
<i>Keita-kun...</i>

04:56.350 --> 04:57.230
<i>Haruko...</i>

04:58.900 --> 05:02.150
The movie was... p-pretty interesting, huh?

05:02.150 --> 05:05.780
Yeah. I guess it pays to go 
into things with an open mind.

05:06.240 --> 05:10.280
You were looking really focused. 
Are you into that kinda thing?

05:10.280 --> 05:12.660
<i>Does he like pervy stuff that much?!</i>

05:12.660 --> 05:16.670
I actually couldn't get into love 
and romance stories before.

05:16.670 --> 05:20.670
I always thought I was the kind of 
guy who couldn't relate to all that.

05:21.460 --> 05:23.050
But now... I don't know why...

05:23.510 --> 05:25.840
Because I fell in love with you, maybe?

05:26.510 --> 05:28.800
<i>I'm total scum!</i>

05:28.800 --> 05:29.890
Oh, yeah.

05:31.180 --> 05:33.560
Here. It's your Christmas present.

05:35.730 --> 05:37.440
Thanks...

05:37.440 --> 05:39.180
Go on. Open it.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.740
Wh-What do you think?

05:48.740 --> 05:52.240
This kind of thing really 
doesn't suit me, huh?

05:52.870 --> 05:54.290
<i>I'm so glad I bought those.</i>

05:54.290 --> 05:56.330
Say something!

05:56.710 --> 05:59.670
Actually, I have something for you, too.

06:00.210 --> 06:01.670
Here you go.

06:03.090 --> 06:06.310
No way... Is this a handmade muffler?!

06:06.310 --> 06:09.720
I heard it was a classic gift choice,
 so I gave it a shot,

06:09.720 --> 06:12.550
but it didn't come out well 
enough to actually wear around.

06:12.550 --> 06:14.760
I bet you feel pretty 
awkward just accepting it.

06:16.010 --> 06:18.390
Don't just put it on right away!

06:21.690 --> 06:25.230
<i>The truth is, I don't have any 
complaints about the way Jun is now.</i>

06:25.860 --> 06:30.700
<i>I know he's acting calmer 
because I'm important to him.</i>

06:31.370 --> 06:34.910
<i>It's just... Somehow, I've gotten greedy.</i>

06:35.330 --> 06:37.500
<i>I want to shock him more!</i>

06:37.500 --> 06:39.830
<i>I want to make him like me more!</i>

06:40.870 --> 06:43.880
It's getting dark. Ready to head home?

06:49.680 --> 06:52.510
I'll go... to your house.

06:52.510 --> 06:53.550
Huh?!

06:53.550 --> 06:55.930
But it's already night—

07:03.060 --> 07:06.440
So your mom's out again today, huh?

07:07.320 --> 07:10.100
I think she'll be back by nightfall, though.

07:10.100 --> 07:11.280
Oh.

07:13.740 --> 07:14.910
I know!

07:14.910 --> 07:16.450
Wanna play some games?

07:16.910 --> 07:19.160
No, I'm good.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.170
Okay.

07:33.510 --> 07:34.850
<i>Chill out, me!</i>

07:34.850 --> 07:38.810
<i>I've been alone with Tomo in my 
own room tons of times before!</i>

07:38.810 --> 07:39.680
Hey...

07:42.190 --> 07:43.350
Can I...

07:44.150 --> 07:46.650
sit next to you?

08:04.380 --> 08:06.750
I knew I wasn't cut out for bargaining!

08:07.090 --> 08:11.010
I came here today... to kiss you!

08:11.010 --> 08:12.120
Kiss me?!

08:12.120 --> 08:15.800
T-To kiss me?! Where did that even...

08:15.800 --> 08:16.850
You don't want to?

08:16.850 --> 08:19.430
No, it's not that I don't want to...

08:19.430 --> 08:21.060
I guess...

08:21.600 --> 08:25.270
I don't have any feminine 
appeal after all, huh?

08:29.860 --> 08:31.120
Tomo!

08:31.120 --> 08:33.280
Huh?! Jun?!

08:33.570 --> 08:34.910
<i>Is it gonna happen?!</i>

08:34.910 --> 08:35.990
<i>Are we...</i>

08:35.990 --> 08:38.070
<i>Are we about to do </i>that<i>?!</i>

08:39.620 --> 08:41.120
<i>He's making a fist?!</i>

08:41.120 --> 08:42.400
<i>Is that a thing, too?!</i>

08:44.000 --> 08:46.210
<i>What?!</i>

08:46.210 --> 08:48.790
What the hell are you doing?! Are you okay?!

08:49.630 --> 08:50.840
Tomo...

08:51.340 --> 08:54.010
You have <i>so</i> much appeal!

08:55.010 --> 09:00.810
The desire to kiss you... a-and touch you...
 is constantly on my mind!

09:00.810 --> 09:01.970
Huh?!

09:01.970 --> 09:05.640
But I don't think it's right to just 
do those things without any thought!

09:06.100 --> 09:07.770
I want them to be special.

09:08.400 --> 09:09.610
Jun...

09:10.270 --> 09:12.570
So I can't do that now.

09:13.240 --> 09:16.240
I haven't even asked you 
to be my girlfriend yet.

09:16.240 --> 09:20.120
You're right. We're not even going out yet.

09:23.870 --> 09:26.870
Wait, we weren't even going out yet?!

09:28.420 --> 09:31.130
Actually, after I told you
 how I felt about you,

09:31.130 --> 09:34.300
I went to talk to your parents.

09:34.300 --> 09:37.630
Akemi-san gave our 
relationship her blessing,

09:37.630 --> 09:39.430
but your dad...

09:39.890 --> 09:42.220
If you want to date Tomo,

09:42.220 --> 09:44.850
you have to defeat me first!

09:44.850 --> 09:46.350
That's what he said.

09:47.190 --> 09:51.150
Dad, you stupid piece of shit!

09:51.980 --> 09:57.400
How could you tell him he can't date 
Tomo unless he beats you? Poor Jun-bo.

09:57.400 --> 09:58.450
Yeah.

09:58.950 --> 10:02.030
So? Why are you all depressed now?

10:03.160 --> 10:04.500
Tomo is...

10:05.000 --> 10:07.960
She's really my daughter, huh?

10:13.170 --> 10:15.340
You're asking that after all this time?

10:16.220 --> 10:19.010
You won't find a cuter 
daughter than her anywhere.

10:19.890 --> 10:22.720
Damn you, old man!

10:22.720 --> 10:23.810
Tomo?

10:24.430 --> 10:26.390
You know what this is about, don't you?

10:26.390 --> 10:27.140
Mm...

10:27.840 --> 10:31.060
Why'd you tell him he can't 
date me unless he defeats you?

10:31.060 --> 10:33.190
What were you thinking when 
you said that to Jun?!

10:33.610 --> 10:35.610
M-Mm...

10:35.610 --> 10:38.820
Quit your stupid grunting 
and answer me, asshole!

10:39.450 --> 10:41.450
M-Mm...

10:41.450 --> 10:44.910
Damn it! You're gonna keep 
me in the dark, then?

10:45.580 --> 10:46.500
Forget it!

10:46.500 --> 10:47.290
Tomo?

10:48.580 --> 10:49.750
Dad...

10:51.040 --> 10:52.500
I hate you!

10:52.880 --> 10:54.630
<i>She hates me?!</i>

11:07.730 --> 11:10.100
Happy New Year, Misuzu-chan.

11:10.350 --> 11:11.690
Happy New Year.

11:13.150 --> 11:15.900
You still can't get in touch with Tomo-chan?

11:15.900 --> 11:17.070
No.

11:17.070 --> 11:18.820
She won't answer her phone,

11:18.820 --> 11:20.990
and my messages aren't even 
being marked as read.

11:20.990 --> 11:23.950
I wanted to do our first shrine 
visit of the year with her.

11:24.280 --> 11:27.240
You haven't heard anything from 
her since Christmas, right?

11:27.240 --> 11:28.410
That's right.

11:28.750 --> 11:30.580
It's Jun-kun, isn't it?

11:30.580 --> 11:33.460
Yes. It has to be him.

11:34.380 --> 11:36.870
Sorry to tell you after you 
took the time to come over,

11:36.880 --> 11:39.550
<b>Aizawa</b>

11:37.460 --> 11:40.840
but she's still saying she 
doesn't want to see anyone.

11:42.630 --> 11:43.840
I see.

11:45.140 --> 11:49.390
H-Hey, I know! Why don't you 
try fighting Goro right now?

11:49.390 --> 11:52.020
He's been off his game.

11:52.020 --> 11:54.940
He might be easier to beat than you think.

11:54.940 --> 11:59.320
No, I'm not in the mood to 
fight right now, either.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.030
N-No, huh?

12:02.150 --> 12:05.370
<b>Back at School</b>

12:05.780 --> 12:07.580
Just wait a minute!

12:07.580 --> 12:08.540
Shut up!

12:09.040 --> 12:11.040
I said wait, Tomo!

12:15.420 --> 12:19.200
Do you know why I'm pissed off?

12:19.200 --> 12:21.920
Because I didn't tell 
you what your dad said?

12:21.920 --> 12:24.720
Bingo. Why didn't you tell me?

12:24.720 --> 12:25.890
Because...

12:26.680 --> 12:28.850
You could have just told me

12:28.850 --> 12:32.560
that you'd go kick my dad's ass, 
so I could just take it easy and wait!

12:32.560 --> 12:34.020
Then I would've...

12:34.020 --> 12:36.980
I can't just ask you to wait for me!

12:39.730 --> 12:43.240
I don't... have to wait?

12:43.700 --> 12:47.950
Yeah. Since it's come to this, 
I intend to face it with all I've got.

12:48.410 --> 12:51.950
But I know it's not gonna be 
that easy to beat your dad.

12:52.500 --> 12:56.880
Defeating him was already my life's goal.

12:57.200 --> 13:01.800
So if I go through my whole 
life never able to beat him,

13:01.800 --> 13:03.130
I'll just...

13:03.720 --> 13:04.930
Get...

13:06.470 --> 13:09.300
Get real!

13:11.020 --> 13:15.230
<i>As long as Jun's like that, he'll never win,
 no matter how capable he is!</i>

13:16.810 --> 13:18.520
Long time no see.

13:18.520 --> 13:21.320
How have you been, Tomo-chan?

13:21.320 --> 13:24.570
You completely ignored us 
all through winter break,

13:24.570 --> 13:26.200
so I guess it's been two weeks?

13:26.200 --> 13:29.910
Do you remember when we said 
we'd all go skiing together?

13:29.910 --> 13:33.450
Um... I'm... really sorry...

13:34.410 --> 13:36.790
So that's what happened.

13:36.790 --> 13:39.460
Well? Do you think he can win?

13:39.460 --> 13:41.130
H-He can!

13:41.130 --> 13:43.510
Maybe not right away, but...

13:43.510 --> 13:47.260
If he takes his training seriously, 
maybe in a few months...

13:47.260 --> 13:49.300
No, maybe a few years...

13:49.300 --> 13:50.510
That's too long.

13:50.850 --> 13:53.390
So what are you going to do?

13:53.390 --> 13:58.180
What do you want me to say? 
There's nothing I <i>can</i> do.

13:58.560 --> 13:59.940
And that's okay with you?

14:02.020 --> 14:05.110
If you want to take the heroine's
stance of silently observing

14:05.110 --> 14:07.610
a battle between two men, that's fine.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.780
But is that what you want?

14:14.610 --> 14:15.500
Tomo!

14:15.500 --> 14:16.840
Wh-What?!

14:17.710 --> 14:20.290
I'm gonna challenge your dad today.

14:25.010 --> 14:28.970
<b>Kashima Daimyojin</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:37.180
<b>Kashima Daimyojin</b>

14:37.180 --> 14:37.980
Damn.

14:37.980 --> 14:40.520
Jun-bo! What the hell are you thinking?!

14:40.520 --> 14:43.970
You said you'd accept my challenge 
at any time, didn't you?

14:44.440 --> 14:47.030
So you will accept it, right?

14:47.030 --> 14:48.700
Very well, then.

14:49.320 --> 14:53.450
I thought if I said that, you'd 
give up on Tomo and run away.

14:53.700 --> 14:56.290
I realize I'm at a huge disadvantage.

14:56.290 --> 15:00.670
So I'll do whatever I have to do to defeat you.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.080
And on that note...

15:02.500 --> 15:04.510
I've called in some support.

15:04.510 --> 15:06.210
H-How dare you?!

15:06.210 --> 15:09.470
Br-Br-Bringing Akemi here is playing dirty!

15:09.880 --> 15:12.090
<i>Jun's challenging my dad right now.</i>

15:12.090 --> 15:15.430
<i>Should I really just stay here?</i>

15:15.430 --> 15:20.640
Aizawa-san... If something's bothering you,
 you can talk to me...

15:20.640 --> 15:21.400
Huh?

15:23.230 --> 15:27.070
I see. So he really went to 
challenge Goro-san, huh?

15:27.570 --> 15:29.360
Jun-kun's amazing.

15:29.360 --> 15:30.780
You said it.

15:30.780 --> 15:35.740
Wait, Senpai, you knew Jun was 
going to challenge my dad?

15:35.740 --> 15:40.460
Yeah, actually, he seemed stressed 
about something over winter break,

15:40.460 --> 15:42.000
so I asked what was up, and...

15:42.420 --> 15:45.040
I know I don't have much chance of winning,

15:45.500 --> 15:49.170
but I'm pretty sure this is 
a battle I have to fight.

15:49.170 --> 15:52.970
So as long as Tomo doesn't abandon me, I...

15:53.640 --> 15:56.060
"I can't give up," he said.

15:56.060 --> 15:59.600
Since he's such a sincere guy, I figured he 
was fighting 'cause he thought he <i>had</i> to...

15:59.600 --> 16:02.850
I think you should cheer Jun-kun on.

16:02.850 --> 16:05.060
I'm sure you know better than anyone...

16:06.190 --> 16:09.690
what would help him the most.

16:12.450 --> 16:14.110
Sorry, Senpai!

16:14.450 --> 16:16.330
I gotta leave early today!

16:27.920 --> 16:29.250
Was that...

16:29.250 --> 16:31.920
Yeah, that wind pressure 
was definitely Tomo.

16:31.920 --> 16:35.140
Looks like she's over it. That's great.

16:35.140 --> 16:38.680
You're right. She must have had an epiphany.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.860
Why don't you just give up already?

16:46.860 --> 16:49.440
You can't defeat me as you are now.

16:50.110 --> 16:52.990
Not... Not yet!

17:00.240 --> 17:03.290
Hey, you okay? You're really wrecked.

17:03.290 --> 17:05.210
This is nothi—

17:05.210 --> 17:06.710
Wait, Tomo?!

17:06.710 --> 17:08.420
Wh-Why are you here?!

17:08.420 --> 17:10.960
Well, I was thinking about it.

17:10.960 --> 17:13.050
You wanna go out with me, right?

17:13.050 --> 17:13.670
Huh?

17:13.670 --> 17:15.760
I wanna go out with you, too!

17:15.760 --> 17:18.010
And the only one in the way of that...

17:18.430 --> 17:19.970
is my old man!

17:20.680 --> 17:24.600
So it's fine if I defeat you instead, right?

17:24.600 --> 17:26.190
<i>What kind of logic is that?!</i>

17:26.190 --> 17:28.480
This is between me and your dad!

17:28.480 --> 17:30.480
I know, I know!

17:30.480 --> 17:33.280
I'm not trying to show up in the 
middle of your fight and butt in.

17:33.530 --> 17:36.660
But if you go down and can't get 
back up, then it's my turn.

17:36.660 --> 17:39.990
And I'll beat him, so you can lose 
without worrying about anything.

17:40.780 --> 17:43.870
<i>Those eyes... She's serious.</i>

17:44.830 --> 17:46.420
Oh, really?

17:46.790 --> 17:48.330
<i>Well, now you've done it.</i>

17:48.750 --> 17:50.880
<i>That's a hell of a lot of pressure!</i>

17:50.880 --> 17:54.470
Yo, Jun. I was watching for 
a bit, and I think Dad...

17:54.470 --> 17:56.340
Yeah, I know.

17:59.180 --> 18:01.600
I'd like one more round, please.

18:01.600 --> 18:04.060
Hmph. You never learn.

18:04.810 --> 18:07.440
<i>Something's different about him today.</i>

18:07.810 --> 18:10.610
<i>He's taking some wide swings 
that leave him open.</i>

18:10.980 --> 18:15.070
<i>If he's doing that on purpose, 
then what he's testing is...</i>

18:17.360 --> 18:20.160
<i>There it is! A wide right!</i>

18:20.570 --> 18:22.990
<i>As often as he's doing it, 
it's gotta be intentional.</i>

18:22.990 --> 18:25.290
<i>And if there's an opening, 
I just have to take it!</i>

18:25.580 --> 18:27.290
<i>It's as simple as that...</i>

18:28.080 --> 18:30.250
<i>to say, at least!</i>

18:30.790 --> 18:32.750
<b>Kashima Daimyojin</b>

18:33.500 --> 18:37.420
<i>I can't beat him with hit-and-away 
strikes that have no momentum.</i>

18:37.420 --> 18:40.260
<i>I have to step right into his reach, 
without thinking about consequences,</i>

18:40.260 --> 18:42.730
<i>and deal a counter that uses 
his own strength against him.</i>

18:42.970 --> 18:46.310
<i>That's probably what it's 
gonna take to beat him.</i>

18:48.390 --> 18:50.230
<i>That's a real challenge for me.</i>

18:51.020 --> 18:54.400
<i>But it's a hurdle Tomo 
could overcome easily.</i>

18:54.400 --> 18:56.400
<i>That's probably the point of this test.</i>

18:57.150 --> 19:01.320
<i>Every day, somewhere in this world, 
someone is unfairly getting hurt.</i>

19:02.240 --> 19:06.200
<i>What if that happened 
to someone close to me?</i>

19:07.000 --> 19:09.750
<i>Tomo would act faster than anyone.</i>

19:10.620 --> 19:12.920
<i>If I hesitate for a second, 
she'll be beyond my reach,</i>

19:12.920 --> 19:14.840
<i>and I'll end up leaving her alone.</i>

19:16.090 --> 19:18.670
<i>I get it, old man.</i>

19:18.670 --> 19:21.680
<i>That's why you're so worried 
about her, isn't it?</i>

19:22.050 --> 19:25.420
<i>I'm sorry the man next to 
her is someone like me.</i>

19:27.100 --> 19:28.480
Here I come!

19:28.480 --> 19:29.520
Come.

19:32.020 --> 19:33.860
<i>I'm not like Tomo.</i>

19:34.570 --> 19:37.400
<i>I can't put my life on the 
line for a total stranger.</i>

19:38.440 --> 19:40.780
<i>The only one I could hope to do that for...</i>

19:41.700 --> 19:44.240
<i>is the girl I love!</i>

19:44.240 --> 19:48.290
Go, Jun!

20:08.600 --> 20:10.810
Jun... wo—

20:10.810 --> 20:13.060
Not enough!

20:13.060 --> 20:14.560
What?!

20:14.560 --> 20:16.770
Oh, enough already!

20:18.400 --> 20:19.570
Huh?

20:20.280 --> 20:21.740
It's true.

20:22.150 --> 20:26.780
For just a moment, my fingers 
did touch the floor.

20:27.410 --> 20:30.370
You win, Junichiro.

20:32.080 --> 20:36.500
I... I actually beat—

20:36.500 --> 20:38.130
Yes!

20:38.130 --> 20:40.590
You won! You beat him!

20:41.220 --> 20:44.130
C'mon, Tomo, that hurts!

20:44.130 --> 20:45.340
Well done.

20:44.130 --> 20:46.220
You actually did it!

20:47.720 --> 20:49.210
I give! I give!

20:51.140 --> 20:53.350
So you beat Dad, right?

20:53.850 --> 20:54.810
Yeah.

20:55.190 --> 20:58.520
Which means... it's okay now, right?

20:58.520 --> 21:00.690
Y'know, to go out with m—

21:00.690 --> 21:01.940
Wait!

21:02.900 --> 21:05.910
I love you, Tomo! Please go out with me!

21:05.910 --> 21:06.740
Huh?

21:07.700 --> 21:09.370
What?!

21:09.370 --> 21:12.450
I was about to say that! 
Why'd you interrupt?!

21:12.450 --> 21:13.790
Why'd <i>you</i> have to say it?!

21:13.790 --> 21:16.040
It's the guy's job to say that, isn't it?

21:16.040 --> 21:17.960
There's no law saying it has to be!

21:18.420 --> 21:21.090
If you're gonna do that, then I'm gonna...

21:31.510 --> 21:34.060
Wh-What did you just...

21:34.060 --> 21:35.660
You were amazing.

21:35.660 --> 21:36.760
Huh?

21:37.040 --> 21:41.240
When you beat my dad, you looked amazing.

21:41.830 --> 21:44.170
Watching you made my heart race.

21:45.000 --> 21:45.870
But...

21:45.870 --> 21:47.540
You'd better be ready!

21:47.540 --> 21:53.090
From now on, I'm gonna be making 
<i>your</i> heart race a lot more!

21:55.780 --> 21:58.040
I guess it's on, then.

22:01.070 --> 22:02.150
Yeah!

22:04.240 --> 22:05.930
You'll never beat me!

22:10.800 --> 22:14.560
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.560 --> 22:18.850
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.850 --> 22:23.320
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.320 --> 22:25.860
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.650 --> 22:29.200
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.860 --> 22:28.490
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.200 --> 22:32.990
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.160 --> 22:38.580
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.580 --> 22:43.550
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.550 --> 22:47.420
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.420 --> 22:52.010
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.010 --> 23:00.900
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.900 --> 23:09.990
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:09.990 --> 23:13.950
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:13.950 --> 23:18.870
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:16.820 --> 23:20.950
<i>One year ago, in spring, I confessed my love.</i>

23:18.870 --> 23:22.840
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:21.870 --> 23:26.380
<i>Without the support of everyone around me, 
this love wouldn't have come to be.</i>

23:22.840 --> 23:27.880
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.750 --> 23:30.010
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:28.510 --> 23:32.090
<i>I, Aizawa Tomo, am now...</i>

23:30.260 --> 23:34.810
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:33.550 --> 23:37.250
<i>the happiest I could possibly be!</i>

23:34.810 --> 23:38.850
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
